=== domain ls :: $ ployz domain ls
acme.com	web → PORT	Setting up · Deploying

=== domain ls --json :: $ ployz domain ls --json
{
  "domains": [
    {
      "action": null,
      "hostname": "acme.com",
      "kind": "custom",
      "port": null,
      "reason": "Deploying",
      "service": "web",
      "status": "setting_up"
    }
  ],
  "environment": {
    "id": "9d524a17-4056-47c0-9fc8-c7329841a90b",
    "name": "production",
    "project": "shop",
    "revision": 9
  }
}

=== domain add, duplicate host :: $ ployz domain add web shop.example.org
Staged domain shop.example.org on web in shop/production (revision 13).

=== domain add, unknown service :: $ ployz domain add nosuch
No Service named nosuch in Environment production
valid: web, api, postgres, worker

=== domain add, unknown service --json :: $ ployz domain add nosuch --json
{"error":{"code":"not_found","details":{"did_you_mean":null,"valid_children":["web","api","postgres","worker"]},"message":"No Service named nosuch in Environment production"}}

=== domain add, bad host :: $ ployz domain add web not\ a\ host
Expected a hostname like app.example.com

=== domain set, prefix with a dot :: $ ployz domain set api my.api
Expected one DNS label, like shop

=== domain ls after changes :: $ ployz domain ls
acme.com	web → PORT	Setting up · Deploying
shop.example.org	web → PORT	Setting up · Live after your next deploy
docs.example.org	web → 8080	Setting up · Live after your next deploy
myapi	api → PORT	Setting up · Live after your next deploy
myworker	worker → PORT	Setting up · Live after your next deploy

=== domain check acme.com :: $ ployz domain check acme.com
acme.com	web → PORT	Setting up · Deploying

=== domain check acme.com --json :: $ ployz domain check acme.com --json
{
  "domain": {
    "action": null,
    "hostname": "acme.com",
    "kind": "custom",
    "port": null,
    "reason": "Deploying",
    "service": "web",
    "status": "setting_up"
  },
  "environment": {
    "id": "9d524a17-4056-47c0-9fc8-c7329841a90b",
    "name": "production",
    "project": "shop",
    "revision": 15
  }
}

=== domain check unknown :: $ ployz domain check nope.example.org
No such domain in Environment production
valid: acme.com, shop.example.org, docs.example.org, myapi, myworker

=== domain rm unknown :: $ ployz domain rm nope.example.org
No such domain in Environment production
valid: acme.com, myapi, myworker

=== domain rm unknown --json :: $ ployz domain rm nope.example.org --json
{"error":{"code":"not_found","details":{"valid_children":["acme.com","myapi","myworker"]},"message":"No such domain in Environment production"}}

=== domain ls --project nosuch :: $ ployz domain ls --project nosuch
No Project named nosuch

